#: ../../quickstart.md:1
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Ukuqalisa ngokushesha"

#: ../../quickstart.md:3
msgid "Make your first request and read the response in about five minutes."
msgstr "Yenza i-request yakho yokuqala bese ufunda impendulo cishe emizuzwini emihlanu."

#: ../../quickstart.md:5
msgid ""
"You need one of these on your machine: `curl`, Python 3.9 or later with "
"the `requests` package, or Node.js 18 or later. Nothing else to install."
msgstr ""
"Udinga okukodwa kwalokhu emshinini wakho: `curl`, Python 3.9 noma eyakamuva "
"ene-package `requests`, noma i-Node.js 18 noma eyakamuva. Akukho okunye "
"okudingeka ukufake."

#: ../../quickstart.md:7
msgid "1. Set your environment"
msgstr "1. Setha i-environment yakho"

#: ../../quickstart.md:9
msgid ""
"Your API key and the server address live in environment variables, so "
"they never end up in your code."
msgstr ""
"I-API key yakho kanye nekheli le-server kugcinwa kuma-environment variables, "
"ukuze kungalokothi kugcine ku-code yakho."

#: ../../quickstart.md:11
msgid "The demo key below is public. It is limited to 10 requests per minute."
msgstr ""
"I-demo key engezansi isesidlangalaleni. Inomkhawulo wama-request angu-10 ngomzuzu."

#: ../../quickstart.md:19
msgid ""
"If the demo server has been idle, the first request can take up to a "
"minute to respond. Later requests are fast."
msgstr ""
"Uma i-demo server ibingasebenzi, i-request yokuqala ingathatha kuze kube "
"umzuzu ukuphendula. Ama-request alandelayo ayashesha."

#: ../../quickstart.md:22
msgid "2. Send your first request"
msgstr "2. Thumela i-request yakho yokuqala"

#: ../../quickstart.md:24
msgid "Ask the large model a question. Pick the tab for your language."
msgstr "Buza i-large model umbuzo. Khetha ithebhu yolimi lwakho."

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "curl"
msgstr "curl"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "Python"
msgstr "Python"

#: ../../quickstart.md
msgid "JavaScript"
msgstr "JavaScript"

#: ../../quickstart.md:49
msgid "3. Read the response"
msgstr "3. Funda impendulo"

#: ../../quickstart.md:51
msgid ""
"A successful request returns status `200` and a JSON body like this. Your"
" `id` will differ."
msgstr ""
"I-request ephumelele ibuyisa i-status `200` kanye ne-JSON body efana nale. "
"I-`id` yakho izohluka."

#: ../../quickstart.md:68
msgid ""
"The model is a stub, so `output` repeats your prompt inside a fixed "
"sentence. That keeps every example on these pages reproducible. The shape"
" of the response is what matters here."
msgstr ""
"I-model iyi-stub, ngakho i-`output` iphinda i-prompt yakho ngaphakathi "
"komusho ongaguquki. Lokhu kwenza zonke izibonelo kula makhasi ziphindaphindeke. "
"Okubalulekile lapha ukwakheka kwe-response."

#: ../../quickstart.md:70
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:71
msgid ""
"A unique ID for this generation. Log it if you need to refer to the "
"generation later."
msgstr ""
"I-ID eyingqayizivele yalokhu kukhiqizwa. Yifake ku-log uma uzodinga "
"ukubhekisela kulokhu kukhiqizwa kamuva."

#: ../../quickstart.md:73
msgid "`model`"
msgstr "`model`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:74
msgid "The model that handled the request."
msgstr "I-model ephethe i-request."

#: ../../quickstart.md:76
msgid "`language`"
msgstr "`language`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:77
msgid "The language code you sent. If you leave it out, it defaults to `en`."
msgstr ""
"I-language code oyithumile. Uma uyishiya ngaphandle, okuzenzakalelayo ngu-`en`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:79
msgid "`output`"
msgstr "`output`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:80
msgid "The generated text."
msgstr "Umbhalo okhiqiziwe."

#: ../../quickstart.md:82
msgid "`finish_reason`"
msgstr "`finish_reason`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:83
msgid ""
"Why the response ended. `stop` means it finished naturally. `length` "
"means it hit your `max_tokens` limit and was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Isizathu sokuthi i-response iphele. `stop` kusho ukuthi iphele ngokwemvelo. "
"`length` kusho ukuthi ifinyelele kumkhawulo wakho we-`max_tokens` yabe isikwa."

#: ../../quickstart.md:85
msgid "`usage`"
msgstr "`usage`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:86
msgid ""
"How many tokens the request used. `total_tokens` is `prompt_tokens` plus "
"`completion_tokens`. See [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) for how tokens"
" are counted."
msgstr ""
"Inani lama-token asetshenziswe yi-request. `total_tokens` yi-`prompt_tokens` "
"kanye ne-`completion_tokens`. Bheka [Tokens and languages](tokens.md) ukuze "
"ubone ukuthi ama-token abalwa kanjani."

#: ../../quickstart.md:88
msgid "When the response is cut off"
msgstr "Lapho i-response isikwa"

#: ../../quickstart.md:90
msgid ""
"Set `max_tokens` to 10 and send the same prompt. The output stops early "
"and `finish_reason` changes to `length`."
msgstr ""
"Setha i-`max_tokens` ibe ngu-10 bese uthumela i-prompt efanayo. I-output "
"izoma kusenesikhathi futhi i-`finish_reason` ishintshe ibe yi-`length`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:107
msgid ""
"If you see `length` and you expected a full answer, raise `max_tokens`. "
"Each model has its own ceiling, listed under `max_output_tokens` in the "
"[model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."
msgstr ""
"Uma ubona `length` futhi ubulindele impendulo ephelele, khulisa "
"`max_tokens`. I-model ngayinye inomkhawulo wayo, obhalwe ngaphansi "
"kwama-`max_output_tokens` ku-[model list](#choose-a-model-and-language)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:109
msgid "Response headers"
msgstr "Ama-response headers"

#: ../../quickstart.md:111
msgid "Every response carries headers worth knowing about."
msgstr "Yonke i-response inama-header okufanele uwazi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Header"
msgstr "I-Header"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Incazelo"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Request-ID`"
msgstr "`X-Request-ID`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Unique ID for this request. Quote it when you contact support."
msgstr ""
"I-ID eyingqayizivele yale request. Yisho uma uxhumana ne-support."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-Data-Region`"
msgstr "`X-Data-Region`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "The region that processed the request. Only on `/v1/generate`."
msgstr ""
"I-region ecubungule i-request. Itholakala kuphela ku-`/v1/generate`."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many requests you get per minute."
msgstr "Inani lama-request owatholayo ngomzuzu."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "How many you have left in the current minute."
msgstr "Inani lama-request asele kuwe kule minithi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../quickstart.md:43
msgid "Seconds until the counter resets."
msgstr "Inani lamasekhondi kuze i-counter iqale kabusha."

#: ../../quickstart.md:121
msgid "Choose a model and language"
msgstr "Khetha i-model nolimi"

#: ../../quickstart.md:123
msgid "List the models to see which languages each one accepts."
msgstr "Bhala uhlu lwama-model ukuze ubone ukuthi ngayinye yamukela ziphi izilimi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:146
msgid ""
"The language codes are `en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` "
"Yoruba, `lg` Luganda and `am` Amharic. If you send a language the model "
"does not support, you get an `unsupported_language` error that lists the "
"ones it does. See [Errors](errors.md)."
msgstr ""
"Ama-language codes yi-`en` English, `sw` Swahili, `ha` Hausa, `yo` Yoruba, "
"`lg` Luganda kanye ne-`am` Amharic. Uma uthumela ulimi i-model engalusekeli, "
"uzothola i-error `unsupported_language` ebala izilimi elizisekelayo. "
"Bheka [Errors](errors.md)."

#: ../../quickstart.md:148
msgid "Choose a region"
msgstr "Khetha i-region"

#: ../../quickstart.md:150
msgid ""
"The `region` parameter tells the service where to process your request. "
"Use `ke` for Kenya, `ug` for Uganda, `ma` for Morocco or `mu` for "
"Mauritius. If you leave it out, the default is `ke`. The `X-Data-Region` "
"response header confirms where the request ran."
msgstr ""
"I-parameter `region` itshela i-service ukuthi i-request yakho icutshungulwe "
"kuphi. Sebenzisa `ke` eKenya, `ug` e-Uganda, `ma` e-Morocco noma `mu` "
"eMauritius. Uma uyishiya ngaphandle, okuzenzakalelayo ngu-`ke`. "
"I-response header `X-Data-Region` iqinisekisa ukuthi i-request yenzeke kuphi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:152
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "Izinyathelo ezilandelayo"

#: ../../quickstart.md:154
msgid "[Authentication](authentication.md) explains keys in more detail."
msgstr "[Authentication](authentication.md) ichaza ama-key ngokuningiliziwe."

#: ../../quickstart.md:155
msgid "[Errors](errors.md) covers every error and which ones to retry."
msgstr "[Errors](errors.md) ichaza wonke ama-error nokuthi yimaphi okufanele uzame futhi."

#: ../../quickstart.md:156
msgid "[Production checklist](production.md) is what to review before you ship."
msgstr ""
"[Production checklist](production.md) yilokho okufanele ukubuyekeze ngaphambi "
"kokuthi ukhiphe uhlelo."